WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CITI-FX: Renata, quick update, the client is getting nervous, we are inside the last twenty minutes before the fix.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Renata: Understood, I have filled about sixty percent of the two hundred fifty million so far.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
CITI-FX: They are asking if we should split the remainder across two banks to reduce market impact.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Renata: That is reasonable given the size left, how much would you want to route elsewhere?

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
CITI-FX: Roughly half of what remains, so about fifty million through us and the rest through you.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Renata: I can work with that, it actually makes the remaining fill easier to manage cleanly.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
CITI-FX: Good, the client wants confirmation before the fix opens, can you confirm in the next five minutes?

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Renata: Confirmed, I will finish my remaining fifty million into the fix as agreed.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
CITI-FX: Perfect, I will let the client know the plan is locked in on both sides.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Renata: Sounds good. I will send the fill summary the moment the fix prints.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
CITI-FX: Appreciate you moving fast on this, it has been a long morning for everyone involved.

12
00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Renata: No problem at all, glad we could get it sorted before the deadline.

13
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:20.000
CITI-FX: One last thing, the client mentioned they may have similar flow again later this week.

14
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Renata: Good to know, have them reach out directly to me next time to save the back and forth.

15
00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:00.000
CITI-FX: Will do, thanks again Renata.

16
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Renata: Thank you, talk soon.
